---
title: Use the Nx Cloud Public API with an AI agent
description: Install the Nx Cloud API skills, authenticate your agent, and investigate CI failures and cache behavior with recorded evidence.
filter: 'type:Guides'
topics:
  - 'Nx Cloud'
